.* QEZBCKUP: the backup displays (DSPBCKUP for the daily, weekly and
.* monthly options), the GO SAVE and GO RESTORE command defaults, and
.* the list of commands an option is about to run.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ONECL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LINECL BASETYPE='CHAR 76'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=LASTDATE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=LASTTAP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=BCKDEV CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=TAPSET1 CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=TAPSET2 CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=TAPSET3 CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=TAPSET4 CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=TAPSET5 CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=TAPSET6 CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=TAPSET7 CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CLRTAP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRFLR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRDIR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SECDTA CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CFGDTA CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SBMJOB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CHGONLY CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PRTRPT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EXITPGM CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DEV1 CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DEV2 CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DEV3 CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DEV4 CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PMTCMD CLASS=ONECL.
:VAR NAME=CHKACT CLASS=ONECL.
:VAR NAME=MSGDLV CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=STRTIM CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=VRYOFF CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=UNMNT CLASS=ONECL.
:VAR NAME=PRTINF CLASS=ONECL.
:VAR NAME=RPYL CLASS=ONECL.
:VAR NAME=SPLDTA CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CMDLINE CLASS=LINECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=CMDS VARS='CMDLINE'.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.F1=Help
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='RETURN 16'.F16=Display library backup list
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION='RETURN 17'.F17=Display folder backup list
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=PRMKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.F1=Help
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPBCKD HELP=HLPDSP KEYL=DSPKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Daily Backup Options
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI VAR=LASTDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Last backup date
:DATAI VAR=LASTTAP USAGE=OUTPUT.Last tape set used
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=SPACE.Where to back up
:DATAI VAR=BCKDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Backup device
:DATAI VAR=TAPSET1 USAGE=OUTPUT.Tape sets to rotate
:DATAI VAR=TAPSET2 USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=TAPSET3 USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=TAPSET4 USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=TAPSET5 USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=TAPSET6 USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=TAPSET7 USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=CLRTAP USAGE=OUTPUT.Erase tape before backup
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=SPACE.What to back up
:DATAI VAR=USRLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.User libraries
:DATAI VAR=USRFLR USAGE=OUTPUT.Folders
:DATAI VAR=USRDIR USAGE=OUTPUT.User directories
:DATAI VAR=SECDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.Security data
:DATAI VAR=CFGDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.Configuration
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=SPACE.How to back up
:DATAI VAR=SBMJOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Submit backup as a batch job
:DATAI VAR=CHGONLY USAGE=OUTPUT.Save changed objects only
:DATAI VAR=PRTRPT USAGE=OUTPUT.Print detailed report
:DATAI VAR=EXITPGM USAGE=OUTPUT.User exit program
:EDATAGRP.
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPBCKW HELP=HLPDSP KEYL=DSPKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Weekly Backup Options
