:EDATAGRP.
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPBCKM HELP=HLPDSP KEYL=DSPKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Monthly Backup Options
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI VAR=LASTDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Last backup date
:DATAI VAR=LASTTAP USAGE=OUTPUT.Last tape set used
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=SPACE.Where to back up
:DATAI VAR=BCKDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Backup device
:DATAI VAR=TAPSET1 USAGE=OUTPUT.Tape sets to rotate
:DATAI VAR=TAPSET2 USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=TAPSET3 USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=TAPSET4 USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=TAPSET5 USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=TAPSET6 USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=TAPSET7 USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=CLRTAP USAGE=OUTPUT.Erase tape before backup
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=SPACE.What to back up
:DATAI VAR=USRLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.User libraries
:DATAI VAR=USRFLR USAGE=OUTPUT.Folders
